<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Ever been on a call where you saw people focusing=
 on how you said something rather than what you said?</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">What if you can now speak as you normally speak, =
without repeating yourself, slowing down, or choosing simpler words? To sol=
ve this =E2=80=98understanding=E2=80=99 problem during meetings, we=E2=80=
=99ve built something different at Krisp =E2=80=93 Accent Conversion, which=
 adapts the audio only for the listener. The speaker talks normally. On the=
 listener=E2=80=99s side, the accent is converted into neutral American Eng=
lish in real time.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Key features</span></p>
<ul style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%">
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Listener-side ac=
cent conversion: Speakers keep their natural voice and accent.</span></li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Real-time unders=
tanding: Converts accented English to neutral American English instantly.</=
span></li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">On-device AI: Au=
dio is processed locally; nothing leaves your computer.</span></li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Near-zero latenc=
y: ~200ms delay, which feels natural in conversation.</span></li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Works everywhere=
: Compatible with Zoom, Teams, Google Meet, and most meeting platforms.</sp=
an></li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">The best AI tools don=E2=80=99t always look drama=
tic. Sometimes they just remove a tiny friction point that happens thousand=
s of times every day in global teams.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Test it in your meetings, I=E2=80=99d love to hea=
r what you think.</span></p>
