<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">The QuitGPT / #CancelChatGPT movement has gone ma=
ssively viral on social media, with users furious over OpenAI=E2=80=99s qui=
ck Department of War deal right after Anthropic refused to drop its safety =
red lines and got blacklisted.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">People are calling out perceived hypocrisy=E2=80=
=94Altman had praised Anthropic=E2=80=99s stance on no mass surveillance or=
 autonomous weapons earlier that day, only for OpenAI to sign hours later, =
labeling it a sell-out for military contracts over ethics.</span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Thousands are posting proof of canceled subscript=
ions, deleted accounts, and switches to Claude, framing the boycott as resi=
stance to enabling authoritarian tools or =E2=80=9Ckiller robots.=E2=80=9D<=
/span></p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Claims of 1.5=E2=80=932.5 million participants (v=
ia <span style=3D"text-decoration: none;"><span style=3D"color: #0600ff;"><=
span style=3D"text-decoration: none;">quitgpt.org</span> </span>p</span>led=
ges, app uninstalls, and migrations) keep the outrage trending hard.</span>=
</p>
<p style=3D"font-size:16px; line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: L=
ato, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Buzz centers on how easy and impactful the action=
 is: canceling takes seconds, switching costs nothing, and every unsubscrib=
e hurts OpenAI=E2=80=99s revenue. Users cheer Claude hitting #1 on app stor=
es, surging downloads, and ChatGPT=E2=80=99s plummeting rankings, plus floo=
d of 1-star reviews. The core sentiment is moral clarity=E2=80=94=E2=80=9CA=
nthropic stands by its principles, OpenAI folded=E2=80=9D=E2=80=94with ongo=
ing calls to delete the app, migrate chats, and urge others to join, turnin=
g this into a powerful symbol of user leverage in the AI ethics fight.</spa=
